==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam cats like [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]], [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]], or any fast damage dealer with meatshields and you should be fine. [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie cats]] work too.

